0..79 Comment "// The region free theorem as naturality, as Rust lets a `&\'long T` stand where"
80..156 Comment "// a `&\'short T` is asked and a function generic in its lifetime cannot tell"
157..234 Comment "// which it was given. A view kept at an outer region stands at an inner one,"
235..307 Comment "// and a function polymorphic in its region commutes with that widening:"
308..386 Comment "// running it at the outer region and widening its answer is one function with"
387..464 Comment "// widening its argument and running it at the inner region. The path between"
465..541 Comment "// the two is checked by conversion. Stating it for every region-polymorphic"
542..619 Comment "// function, held abstractly, needs a value type quantifying a region, #2139."
621..670 Comment "// `pass`, which hands back the thunk it is lent."
671..677 Keyword "import"
